9c-cc55-4bfd-affd-eee20938ad56","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"どこら変が辛かったのかな、パフォーマンスは出そう","ts":"1631250593.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/8Jr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48ec58e6-d7dc-4ed0-8e52-1c76715ca316","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Lua で作ってみたいなーと思っています。今のやつでも不満はそんなにないんですが、Go + yaegi はもういいかなあと","ts":"1631250483.038600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wO6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef54c5bc-776f-46ae-a4b9-a5958439d4d3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003c@U8R597E9H\u003e fuzzy finderは前も作ってると聞いたような、作り直しですかね","ts":"1631250446.038100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7pS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a591a7b-2758-4876-85ac-e5db55d2242c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ただ、telescopeはもう普及しきってるので全てのbuilt in sourcesを分離するのは無理ではないか","ts":"1631250350.037200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TxLqY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecee3dcf-6284-4102-ac82-d1e64add7dc7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"興味深い","ts":"1631250307.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"szn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"618f0f5f-7dd5-4ef2-860b-ac1471a10b7b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/issues/1228|https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/issues/1228\u003e","ts":"1631250303.036000","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/issues/1228|#1228 Move out ALL builtins\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/issues/1228|#1228 Move out ALL builtins\u003e","text":"Disclaimer: This is something TJ just brought up on Discord.\n\nTJ and I think we should move out all builtins to own repositories. like `telescope-files.nvim` `telescope-git.nvim` `telescope-lsp.nvim` etc, ....\n\nNeither TJ nor I enjoy maintaining a lot of the issues that currently are piling up. I only use 5-6 pickers so I am also the wrong person to maintain most of these issues (because i dont have any strong feeling for them) and from my conversation with TJ i think he feels the same.\n\nWe can still have them under `lua/telescope/builtin/` and we can still support them with `:Telescope ...` and configuration with `telescope.setup{ pickers = { ... } }` but with moving them we could gain more flexibility. People can pick whatever picker they need and we (core team and other maintainers) can focus more on the \"engine\" telescope.\n\nWe then can assign more people to these individual repositories.\n\nThoughts are welcome :)","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"enhancement","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"8","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim|nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631199951}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U77"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92aa522a-d5e6-4ae4-a79c-e09fbe788b4c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"それの安定性も含めて確認したいので FF 試しに書いてみる感じですｗ","ts":"1631250054.035700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Xv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5709e10b-8693-4fb6-ac6d-bf4778b80327","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ファイルのパーミッションの問題とかなのかな。。。とりあえず自分はちょいちょい遭遇してました。（以前遊びで使ってみたときに）","ts":"1631249088.035000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EEIh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7e3cdb4-e3d1-4a7b-be22-af73e2ea25f3","type":"message","